  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>′</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>′</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>′</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gia tốc của chất điểm tại thời điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>″</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
